{
  "id": "motor-milestones",
  "term": "motor milestones",
  "definition": "Motor milestones are developmental movement achievements in infancy that signal progress and create new ways for infants to engage with their surroundings and other people. They matter in psychology because early motor development is closely linked with social and language development.",
